{"title": "Potent Healing", "pageid": 28529, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Potent_Healing", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Potent Healing</b> is a passive feature that maximises healing.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Whenever you are healed, you restore the maximum number of possible <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Periapt_of_Wound_Closure\" title=\"Periapt of Wound Closure\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Periapt_of_Wound_Closure_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Periapt_of_Wound_Closure_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Periapt_of_Wound_Closure_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Periapt_of_Wound_Closure_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Periapt_of_Wound_Closure_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Periapt_of_Wound_Closure_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Periapt_of_Wound_Closure_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Periapt_of_Wound_Closure_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Periapt_of_Wound_Closure_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Periapt_of_Wound_Closure\" title=\"Periapt of Wound Closure\">Periapt of Wound Closure</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Potent Healing only maximizes <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> restored <i>to</i> the wearer. There is no change to healing done <i>by</i> the wearer of the amulet to other creatures.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201017\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 849/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7284/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1876/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 688963/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.593      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.593      1 -total\n 54.12%   16.556      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 47.85%   14.640      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 44.96%   13.754      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 23.28%    7.122      1 Template:Item_icon\n 12.54%    3.836      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.58%    3.544      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.20%    3.426      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.16%    2.802      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28529-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201017 and revision id 371046. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}